        "headline": "Wind Advisory issued August 26 at 1:33PM AKDT until August 28 at 4:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...South to southwest winds 25 to 35 mph with gusts up to 50\nmph expected, mainly near the coast.\n\n* WHERE...Kuskokwim Delta, Western Capes, and Northern Bristol Bay\nCoast.\n\n* WHEN...From 10 AM Thursday to 4 PM AKDT Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects and a few\npower outages may result. Travel could be difficult.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...A strong front will approach the Southwest\nAlaska coastline by Thursday morning, bringing southerly to\nsouthwesterly winds ",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
